{"id":"n58356-1-6","stage":4,"title":"벅차다 · 吃力","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58356-1-6-1","ko":"이번 달도 적자가 났네.","zh":"这个月又出现亏损了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"달도","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달도","audio":"/audio/7fa617ed19846243312d.mp3"}},{"text":"적자가","meaning":"赤字","explanation":"적자：赤字；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"적자","audio":"/audio/566c315292ac6544f433.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86433","senseId":"1","lemma":"적자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적자가","audio":"/audio/46d30707e2a63cabb6ca.mp3"}},{"text":"났네.","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"났네","audio":"/audio/61838fe700d98744d637.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"566c315292ac6544","term":"적자","zh":"赤字","audio":"/audio/566c315292ac6544f433.mp3","entryId":"86433","definition":"因出去的钱比进来的钱多而产生的亏损金额。","pronunciation":["적짜"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ba868783ddf3d4226888.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58356-1-6-2","ko":"아이들에게 들어가는 돈이 많아서 지금 생활비로는 벅차.","zh":"孩子们要花的钱太多了，现在的生活费根本不够用。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이들에게","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이들에게","audio":"/audio/a6fe9caa2032f8ab1986.mp3"}},{"text":"들어가는","meaning":"花，投入，花费","explanation":"들어가다：花，投入，花费；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"4","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어가는","audio":"/audio/36561b63f5ea416efd74.mp3"}},{"text":"돈이","meaning":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","explanation":"돈：钱，钱款，价钱，费用；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"2","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈이","audio":"/audio/6fc43b50168ec9dd1ba6.mp3"}},{"text":"많아서","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많아서","audio":"/audio/6a9e779aed8b5a8b02ab.mp3"}},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"생활비로는","meaning":"生活费","explanation":"생활비：生活费；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생활비","audio":"/audio/ef04fe60f21878b08210.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16596","senseId":"1","lemma":"생활비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생활비로는","audio":"/audio/4ee13f507f2526007e3a.mp3"}},{"text":"벅차.","meaning":"吃力，费劲","explanation":"벅차다：吃力，费劲；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"벅차다","audio":"/audio/94f1ee380e7d3c0b703c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58356","senseId":"1","lemma":"벅차다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벅차","audio":"/audio/332cda07ff14cd7b7eef.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"花，投入，花费","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"把钱、努力、物资等用在做某事上。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"购物或做某事时所需的钱财。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"ef04fe60f21878b0","term":"생활비","zh":"生活费","audio":"/audio/ef04fe60f21878b08210.mp3","entryId":"16596","definition":"生活所需的费用。","pronunciation":["생활비"]},{"id":"94f1ee380e7d3c0b","term":"벅차다","zh":"吃力，费劲","audio":"/audio/94f1ee380e7d3c0b703c.mp3","entryId":"58356","definition":"很难完成或承受某事。","pronunciation":["벅차다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e12bef6e773ca7388afb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.809,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58356","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/lice